  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwinenu kuya nakuholokela mana kwindi muchota chawabula kuloŋa, chinjila chacheni. Wukulekeladi kuya muchota chawakwakujila? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himuneluki nenu akwakujila diwu amba kasompesha mpata yamunu mwishinaku, tahindi? Chineli enu yenu mwakasompesha mpata yamunu mwishina, mubuli kutela kusompesha tusaŋu twantesha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himuneluki nenu yetu twamba kasompesha aŋeluku, tahindi? Indi tukukaŋenyadi kusompesha nsaŋu jakumina muwumi wunu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi mukusompesha nsaŋu jakumina muwumi wunu, mukukunjika mudimu wakusompesha akwenu kudi antu aseka muchipompelu, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi chinahoshi nalondi mutiyi nsonyi. Mukachi kenu mubuli kumwekana mukwamaana wumu natweshi kuketula Muloŋa mukachi kawana kwindi, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwaka mwilaŋa mukwakwitiya wumu hakuholokelaŋa mukwakwitiya mukwawu muchota chawakwákubula kwitiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nehi dinu! Ochu chimukudiholokela muntu namukwawu, chikwikala chuma chatama mukachi kenu. Mwalekelapadi kukumina dakwiteja kuyikoŋa chatama? mwalekelaŋadi kukumina dakwiteja kuyidiila yuma yawukombi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka! Enu aweni mwatamishaŋa, mwadyaloŋa yawukombi; eŋa, hela yuma yawana kwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu kwiluka nenu abula kuloŋa hiyamba kaswana wanta waNzambi uku, nehi? Bayi ayidimbaku; hela ayivumbi, hela akwakupesha, hela akwawusenji, hela amayala adilisha neyi ambanda, hela aditamishaŋa nawakwawu amayala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela amakombi, hela akwalwisu, hela akwakusheta walwa, hela akwakutukana, hela akwanyilami, hiyamba kaswana wanta waNzambi uku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ami namonaŋa yuma yonsu nami yaloŋa; ilaŋa yuma yi kwawu hiyakwashanaŋaku. Ami namonaŋa yuma yonsu nami yaloŋa, ilaŋa hineteji chuma nichimu kwikala mwanta wamuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudya kwambala kwamwivumu, niivumu dambala dayakudya; ilaŋa Nzambi wakakisaŋana niivumu niyakudya. Mujimba hiwakwila nachu wuvumbuku, wambala waMwanta niMwanta wambala wamujimba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wasaŋwili Mwanta, wakatusaŋula ninetu naŋovu jindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himuneluki nenu nyijimba yenu yinekali yidi yambala yaKristuku, tahindi? Indi ami nitwali yidi yaKristu niyibalumuni kwikala yachivumbi, tahindi? Chinjila! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himuneluki nenu muntu wakamaŋa nachivumbi anekali dehi mujimba wurauku, tahindi? Muloŋa nindi, Mwayedi wawu akela mujimba wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila muntu wadibomba naMwanta nekali dehi spiritu wumu nayena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temukenu wuvumbi. Chavulumunaŋa antu nyiloŋa yi kwawu chakuminaŋa kunyijimba yawu; hakwila muntu welaŋa wuvumbi waditamishaŋa mujimba windi yomweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himuneluki nenu nyijimba yenu yinekali dehi tembeli yambala yaSpiritu Wajila wudi mudenu, imwatambwili kudi Nzambuku, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himwadihetaku, ayilandili dehi nawuseya. Dichi lemeshenu Nzambi munyijimba yenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
